{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51770","headline":"介庵赠古墨梅酬以一篇 · 詹敦仁","name":"介庵赠古墨梅酬以一篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开屏展素看梅花，淡蕊疎枝蓦蓦斜。\n墨散余香点酥萼，月留残影照窗纱。\n（《永乐大典》二八一二「梅」字韵）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}